WEBVTT

00:00:36.745 --> 00:00:40.040
Ahh... Octopus fishing is fun.

00:00:42.083 --> 00:00:44.169
Ah! You caught something!

00:00:44.169 --> 00:00:45.211
Whoa!

00:00:48.923 --> 00:00:51.259
I caught one! I caught one!

00:00:54.429 --> 00:00:55.263
Ahh!

00:00:55.263 --> 00:00:56.765
H-Hey!

00:01:04.647 --> 00:01:07.317
Ow, ow, ow...

00:01:07.317 --> 00:01:09.361
Hm?

00:01:09.361 --> 00:01:10.612
Wha...?!

00:01:12.697 --> 00:01:14.199
What's wrong, Sis?!

00:01:18.912 --> 00:01:21.539
S-Sis...

00:01:21.539 --> 00:01:23.500
Wet... Wet...

00:01:23.500 --> 00:01:26.586
I-I can't believe it! You're in high school!

00:01:26.586 --> 00:01:30.465
N-No...! No! This is some sort of--

00:01:31.883 --> 00:01:32.884
This...

00:01:32.884 --> 00:01:35.345
I started drinking it last night.

00:01:40.225 --> 00:01:43.770
Good... So that's what happened.

00:01:43.770 --> 00:01:46.481
Yeah, really... good...

00:03:20.575 --> 00:03:24.829
Well, I was having a dream about the ocean.

00:03:24.829 --> 00:03:26.915
Sis, you really are predictable.

00:03:26.915 --> 00:03:29.584
And Aria was in my dream, too.

00:03:29.584 --> 00:03:33.838
Akari is walking eastward
with her sister Nonoka.

00:03:33.838 --> 00:03:35.840
Looks like they're headed towards the bridge.

00:03:37.467 --> 00:03:41.888
Even if I lose in a battle,
I make up for it in no time.

00:03:41.888 --> 00:03:43.973
That's Urara Takachiho's way.

00:03:43.973 --> 00:03:45.850
Miss Urara...

00:03:45.850 --> 00:03:47.477
We'll get there before they do!

00:03:47.477 --> 00:03:49.479
Whole unit, move forward!

00:03:49.479 --> 00:03:51.231
Ah! Please wait for us!

00:03:51.231 --> 00:03:54.609
"Whole unit"? She's only got us!

00:03:54.609 --> 00:03:57.821
The supermarket on the other side
of the bridge is having a sale today.

00:03:57.821 --> 00:04:01.825
It's limited to one per customer,
but you can buy a half dozen eggs for 50 yen!

00:04:01.825 --> 00:04:03.827
We'll walk 3km for the round trip, okay?

00:04:03.827 --> 00:04:04.911
Roger!

00:04:04.911 --> 00:04:09.207
We can eat as many omelets as
we want, huh, Captain Nonoka?!

00:04:09.207 --> 00:04:10.041
Oh?

00:04:10.041 --> 00:04:12.293
--Hm?
--Is that you...?

00:04:15.463 --> 00:04:17.090
Bonjour.

00:04:18.341 --> 00:04:20.844
Akari... what a coincidence.

00:04:20.844 --> 00:04:22.387
Yeah, a coincidence.

00:04:22.387 --> 00:04:24.889
Really, what a coincidence.

00:04:24.889 --> 00:04:26.349
Takachiho!

00:04:26.349 --> 00:04:28.143
Yuyu! Yaya!

00:04:28.143 --> 00:04:33.356
U-Uhm... thank you very much
for those beautiful roses the other day.

00:04:37.694 --> 00:04:42.157
Thank you, too. Your sister
has been very nice to me.

00:04:42.157 --> 00:04:45.326
We're on our way to the grocery store.

00:04:45.326 --> 00:04:49.497
It's limited to one per customer,
but you can buy a pack of eggs for 50 yen!

00:04:49.497 --> 00:04:52.917
Oh? Then we'll come with you.

00:04:52.917 --> 00:04:53.668
What?

00:04:53.668 --> 00:04:55.754
It'll be better to have more people, right?

00:04:55.754 --> 00:04:57.380
Well, it's a bit far to this super--

00:04:57.380 --> 00:04:59.507
Are you sure?! Thank you!

00:04:59.507 --> 00:05:04.346
No problem. We happen to
be taking a walk right now, so...

00:05:07.182 --> 00:05:12.562
So it wasn't nice, you know.
Nonoka thought that I wet my bed.

00:05:12.562 --> 00:05:15.982
Sis, we're having tea, so stop it.

00:05:15.982 --> 00:05:18.276
Sorry about that.

00:05:18.276 --> 00:05:19.527
That's okay.

00:05:19.527 --> 00:05:24.032
The bottled water that I was
drinking before bed just spilled.

00:05:24.032 --> 00:05:28.328
I was having a dream where an
octopus squirted ink on me at the ocean.

00:05:28.328 --> 00:05:31.331
An octopus at the ocean...

00:05:31.331 --> 00:05:35.210
This is good. I can bring up my
invitation without raising suspicion.

00:05:35.210 --> 00:05:39.381
I'm so good, even my luck is good!

00:05:39.381 --> 00:05:42.217
By the way... are you free tomorrow?

00:05:42.217 --> 00:05:43.927
Hm? Yeah, I am.

00:05:43.927 --> 00:05:47.889
Then, let's make your dream
of going to the ocean come true.

00:05:47.889 --> 00:05:51.768
You're invited to the water park
that the Takachiho Conglomerate owns.

00:05:51.768 --> 00:05:54.979
We'll have the place all to ourselves.
I'll prepare your bathing suit, too.

00:05:54.979 --> 00:05:57.774
Whoa! Really?! All right!

00:05:57.774 --> 00:05:59.150
Are you sure?

00:05:59.150 --> 00:06:00.860
We don't have octopuses, though.

00:06:02.696 --> 00:06:04.823
You're a defenseless little goldfish...

00:06:04.823 --> 00:06:10.078
I'll take you into the pool to
deepen our friendship to the fullest.

00:06:12.247 --> 00:06:13.081
Hm?

00:06:13.081 --> 00:06:15.166
Takachiho?

00:06:15.166 --> 00:06:17.252
Okay, then! It's decided!

00:06:17.252 --> 00:06:19.045
Those who'll come tomorrow... Count off!

00:06:19.045 --> 00:06:19.754
One!

00:06:19.754 --> 00:06:20.255
Two...?

00:06:20.255 --> 00:06:20.922
Three!

00:06:20.922 --> 00:06:21.589
Four!

00:06:21.589 --> 00:06:23.091
Five!

00:06:23.091 --> 00:06:23.758
Whoa!

00:06:23.758 --> 00:06:24.342
Six!

00:06:24.342 --> 00:06:25.844
Seven!

00:06:25.844 --> 00:06:26.970
You guys...!

00:06:26.970 --> 00:06:29.848
Hey! I didn't invite you guys!

00:06:29.848 --> 00:06:33.727
They teach us how to track
a tracker in school, you know.

00:06:33.727 --> 00:06:37.063
You made a concession speech
to put me off guard the other day,

00:06:37.063 --> 00:06:40.900
and here you are taking
action already, huh, Takachiho?

00:06:40.900 --> 00:06:43.695
The more the merrier, right?

00:06:43.695 --> 00:06:45.822
Yep, that's right!

00:06:45.822 --> 00:06:50.618
Oh, yeah! Takachiho, can I invite Aria, too?

00:06:51.870 --> 00:06:54.873
Y... Y...

00:06:54.873 --> 00:06:59.544
Yes, you can! You guys can
bring as many friends as you like!

00:06:59.544 --> 00:07:01.880
All right! Sounds like fun!

00:07:01.880 --> 00:07:06.968
Darn it! Just when I thought
I had Akari all to myself...!

00:07:06.968 --> 00:07:09.429
It's your fault for not being cautious enough!

00:07:09.429 --> 00:07:11.097
You deserve a spanking! A spanking!

00:07:11.097 --> 00:07:13.600
Uhm... Takachiho?

00:07:13.600 --> 00:07:16.978
This is part of your education!
It's not violence!

00:07:16.978 --> 00:07:18.313
You idiot!

00:07:18.313 --> 00:07:20.607
Thank you very much!

00:07:27.238 --> 00:07:29.324
Shino...

00:07:29.324 --> 00:07:32.410
Sorry about earlier.

00:07:32.410 --> 00:07:34.037
What do you want?

00:07:34.037 --> 00:07:35.789
Yesterday's enemies...

00:07:36.790 --> 00:07:38.333
...could be today's friends.

00:07:41.002 --> 00:07:43.380
I'm busy.

00:07:43.380 --> 00:07:45.131
I don't wanna go to a pool.

00:07:45.131 --> 00:07:48.343
Hm? Pool?

00:07:48.343 --> 00:07:52.013
But Takachiho is making
it available exclusively to us.

00:07:52.013 --> 00:07:54.474
The place is called Spa Resort Takachiho,

00:07:54.474 --> 00:07:58.186
and it sounds like a big
water park rather than a simple pool.

00:07:58.186 --> 00:07:59.688
Please come, Aria!

00:07:59.688 --> 00:08:01.731
I don't like swimming.

00:08:01.731 --> 00:08:04.317
It's more like you can't swim, right?

00:08:04.317 --> 00:08:07.862
How do you know that?!
I <i>can </i>swim if I have a swim ring!

00:08:07.862 --> 00:08:10.865
Wait... What're you doing at my place, Riko?

00:08:10.865 --> 00:08:12.867
You're a nuisance. Go home already!

00:08:12.867 --> 00:08:14.536
Swim ring?

00:08:14.536 --> 00:08:17.288
Oh, never mind that.
I was talking to someone else.

00:08:17.288 --> 00:08:19.332
Maybe I'll reveal it to her.

00:08:19.332 --> 00:08:23.378
Why don't you join us, Aria?!

00:08:23.378 --> 00:08:26.381
I wanna go to the pool with you guys, too.

00:08:27.549 --> 00:08:29.634
O-Okay, then.

00:08:30.093 --> 00:08:31.594
"The largest indoor resort facility"
"All-weather theme park"

00:08:31.845 --> 00:08:34.097
Geez... this is amazing...

00:08:34.097 --> 00:08:39.269
Pools with beaches, huh?
Just how rich is Takachiho?

00:08:42.313 --> 00:08:44.482
Welcome home!

00:08:44.482 --> 00:08:48.403
Welcome home, Raika.

00:08:48.403 --> 00:08:49.946
Hey! Kirin!

00:08:49.946 --> 00:08:51.406
What're you guys doing here?

00:08:51.406 --> 00:08:56.953
I took Miss Takachiho up on her offer
and asked my friends to join us.

00:08:56.953 --> 00:09:00.665
We were just picking out
bathing suits to wear to the pool.

00:09:00.665 --> 00:09:02.917
Wh-Why the heck are you doing it at my place?

00:09:02.917 --> 00:09:05.879
Oh, I've got some bathing suits for you, too!

00:09:05.879 --> 00:09:08.006
Now, which one would you like?

00:09:08.006 --> 00:09:09.966
You'll definitely look good in this!

00:09:09.966 --> 00:09:11.968
You've got a perfect figure!

00:09:11.968 --> 00:09:13.720
Why don't you wear a G-string?

00:09:13.720 --> 00:09:15.305
Please check out what I have, too!

00:09:15.305 --> 00:09:15.513
See? This one! This one's good!

00:09:15.513 --> 00:09:19.017
Wh-What the hell...?

00:09:19.017 --> 00:09:22.312
What do you think about this?!

00:09:22.312 --> 00:09:24.898
Th-There's no way that I could
wear something embarrassing like that!

00:09:24.898 --> 00:09:28.943
I'll wear a normal one!
Gather these up and go home!

00:09:32.739 --> 00:09:33.615
Ahh!

00:09:33.615 --> 00:09:34.824
You made her cry!

00:09:34.824 --> 00:09:37.869
You made her cry! You made her cry!

00:09:37.869 --> 00:09:39.996
O-Okay, then...

00:09:39.996 --> 00:09:41.664
I'll wear one of these.

00:09:41.664 --> 00:09:44.042
Thank you very much!

00:09:44.042 --> 00:09:48.254
Let's wear cute bathing suits tomorrow
to deepen our friendship with Raika!

00:09:48.254 --> 00:09:49.714
Yeah!

00:09:49.714 --> 00:09:51.091
They got me...

00:09:56.388 --> 00:10:01.017
In order to deepen our friendship
with Akari, why don't we join hands?

00:10:02.602 --> 00:10:09.359
Since it's you who invited her,
I take it you have a high-level strategy.

00:10:10.694 --> 00:10:14.030
That's unusually smart thinking for you, Shino.

00:10:15.782 --> 00:10:18.326
This bathing suit is for Akari.

00:10:18.326 --> 00:10:21.079
It's the same design as mine, but...

00:10:21.079 --> 00:10:27.210
...Akari's is a special bathing suit
that shrinks little by little in water.

00:10:27.210 --> 00:10:28.670
It shrinks?

00:10:28.670 --> 00:10:34.342
Yes, little by little without being noticed...
until it becomes as thin as string.

00:10:34.342 --> 00:10:35.719
String?!

00:10:35.719 --> 00:10:39.014
A bathing suit that turns into string...

00:10:39.014 --> 00:10:40.890
Oh, no!

00:10:42.684 --> 00:10:46.938
...can easily come off!

00:10:46.938 --> 00:10:49.190
I-Incredible...!

00:10:52.027 --> 00:10:58.283
But what if she gets out of the water
before her bathing suit shrinks?

00:10:58.283 --> 00:11:03.288
My strategy is impeccable.

00:11:03.288 --> 00:11:06.374
When this bathing suit
is soaked in warm water...

00:11:10.420 --> 00:11:13.048
it shrinks in an instant.

00:11:13.048 --> 00:11:17.427
I've already prepared a pitfall
to a heated pool by the poolside.

00:11:17.427 --> 00:11:20.597
I'd expect nothing less from my rival.

00:11:20.597 --> 00:11:25.185
Then, I'll contribute, too, with the
skills that I learned from my Amica.

00:11:28.104 --> 00:11:30.899
Beautiful memories should be videotaped

00:11:30.899 --> 00:11:33.651
and watched many times later on.

00:11:33.651 --> 00:11:37.739
I'll record a lot of Akari using this.

00:11:37.739 --> 00:11:40.742
The bathing suit accident scene
will be recorded clearly, too...

00:11:40.742 --> 00:11:42.243
...in high definition.

00:11:46.414 --> 00:11:53.254
If it's for the sake of love,
a small camera can be allowed.

00:11:53.254 --> 00:11:56.383
Go fly to Tokyo where Kin is!

00:11:58.802 --> 00:12:01.221
I'll be in charge of recording.

00:12:01.221 --> 00:12:03.807
I'll be in charge of causing the accident.

00:12:05.266 --> 00:12:07.227
The alliance is formed!

00:12:10.271 --> 00:12:14.067
Welcome to the Spa Resort Takachiho!

00:12:14.067 --> 00:12:16.194
Good morning, Takachiho!

00:12:19.280 --> 00:12:21.199
We have the whole place to ourselves today.

00:12:21.199 --> 00:12:23.159
Whoa! All right!

00:12:23.618 --> 00:12:25.578
W-We overslept!

00:12:25.578 --> 00:12:31.459
Miss Urara is going to scold us!

00:12:31.459 --> 00:12:33.795
H-Hm? Which one's Akari's?

00:12:33.795 --> 00:12:35.380
It's probably this one!

00:12:41.845 --> 00:12:42.846
Hm?

00:12:47.642 --> 00:12:49.310
Here! This is your bathing suit, Akari!

00:12:49.310 --> 00:12:52.355
It's the same design as mine.

00:12:52.355 --> 00:12:54.733
We're lovey-dovey, aren't we? Just kidding!

00:12:54.733 --> 00:12:56.693
Thank you, Takachiho!

00:12:59.279 --> 00:13:02.907
Geez... Sis! Where are your manners?

00:13:02.907 --> 00:13:04.576
Thanks, Nonoka!

00:13:04.576 --> 00:13:05.910
Tsk.

00:13:05.910 --> 00:13:08.538
Well, the pool sounds like
a lot of fun, doesn't it?

00:13:08.538 --> 00:13:10.623
Shut up!

00:13:10.623 --> 00:13:15.920
I'm just chaperoning them,
since they seemed so excited.

00:13:15.920 --> 00:13:19.507
I asked Reki to come, too, for backup.

00:13:19.507 --> 00:13:22.385
So when are you going to swim?

00:13:22.385 --> 00:13:24.554
How many meters are you going to swim?

00:13:24.554 --> 00:13:27.474
How much are you going to pad your breasts?

00:13:27.474 --> 00:13:30.518
Holes Driver!

00:13:30.518 --> 00:13:31.353
One.

00:13:31.353 --> 00:13:32.228
Two.

00:13:32.228 --> 00:13:33.104
Three.

00:13:33.104 --> 00:13:34.731
Humph!

00:13:34.731 --> 00:13:36.066
Whoa!

00:13:36.066 --> 00:13:38.193
It's a beach! It's a beach!

00:13:38.193 --> 00:13:38.985
Whoa...!

00:13:38.985 --> 00:13:42.405
A bleached cotton cloth!
A loincloth! How fashionable!

00:13:42.405 --> 00:13:45.241
I-Is that a Japanese bathing suit?

00:13:45.241 --> 00:13:47.035
That's right.

00:13:47.702 --> 00:13:49.496
--Oof.
--Everyone!

00:13:49.496 --> 00:13:51.373
--Hm?
--Look up.

00:13:51.373 --> 00:13:52.624
Up?

00:13:55.210 --> 00:13:56.419
Wow!

00:13:56.419 --> 00:13:57.671
Whoa...

00:13:57.671 --> 00:13:59.422
How pretty...

00:13:59.422 --> 00:14:03.677
Oh, my... So you really are a woman.

00:14:03.677 --> 00:14:04.678
Huh?

00:14:04.678 --> 00:14:07.055
You look so cute in that bathing suit!

00:14:07.055 --> 00:14:09.224
C-Cute...?

00:14:09.224 --> 00:14:12.060
I'm... cute...?

00:14:12.060 --> 00:14:18.858
Ahhh! You dummy! Don't say things like that!

00:14:18.858 --> 00:14:20.402
Take this!

00:14:32.247 --> 00:14:33.665
Look at these!

00:14:41.756 --> 00:14:44.759
Ah! Dolphins! They're so cute!

00:14:46.302 --> 00:14:48.263
They're dolphin robots.

00:14:48.263 --> 00:14:50.974
That's amazing!

00:14:50.974 --> 00:14:52.684
This is strange...

00:14:58.356 --> 00:15:00.275
It's not shrinking.

00:15:00.275 --> 00:15:01.317
Hm?

00:15:01.317 --> 00:15:04.738
This is amazing! Look! Look!

00:15:06.781 --> 00:15:11.077
Yep, yep. I can see you very
well through the infrared camera.

00:15:12.746 --> 00:15:14.956
I'm scared!

00:15:14.956 --> 00:15:16.833
H-Hey, what are you touching?!

00:15:16.833 --> 00:15:18.793
Whoa! Ahhhh!

00:15:18.793 --> 00:15:21.296
Yahoo!

00:15:22.464 --> 00:15:24.299
You're doing good. You're doing good.

00:15:24.299 --> 00:15:26.092
This starfish is a robot!

00:15:26.092 --> 00:15:27.427
It's cute.

00:15:27.427 --> 00:15:28.636
Whoa! Hey!

00:15:28.636 --> 00:15:31.639
Raika! We're almost out!

00:15:34.142 --> 00:15:34.976
Ow...

00:15:34.976 --> 00:15:35.977
Ah...

00:15:35.977 --> 00:15:37.729
Whoa!

00:15:38.480 --> 00:15:43.985
R-Raika... Everyone's watching...

00:15:43.985 --> 00:15:45.570
You can't do that here!

00:15:45.570 --> 00:15:46.696
Kiss her!

00:15:46.696 --> 00:15:50.658
--Kiss her! Kiss her!
--Hey, there are several things wrong with this situation!

00:15:52.827 --> 00:15:55.955
I-I'm sorry... for interrupting!

00:15:55.955 --> 00:16:00.669
I-I... uhm... I didn't know...
about you two, so...

00:16:00.669 --> 00:16:02.629
What?! I-It's not like that! This is...

00:16:02.629 --> 00:16:04.005
It <i>is </i>like that.

00:16:04.005 --> 00:16:06.174
Whoa! Ahhh!

00:16:07.467 --> 00:16:10.470
Aria, you should swim, too!

00:16:10.470 --> 00:16:14.140
We've got the whole pool to ourselves.
It'll be a waste if you don't.

00:16:14.140 --> 00:16:18.728
I-I can swim... as long as
my legs can reach the bottom.

00:16:18.728 --> 00:16:21.439
I wonder if you're tall
enough to reach the bottom.

00:16:21.439 --> 00:16:23.024
Riko!

00:16:26.194 --> 00:16:27.904
Help!

00:16:31.032 --> 00:16:32.450
Reki!

00:16:32.450 --> 00:16:36.705
I am... a single bullet...

00:16:36.705 --> 00:16:39.374
That hurt!

00:16:39.374 --> 00:16:42.252
I'm gonna pump you full of holes!

00:16:42.252 --> 00:16:45.588
Tee-hee. An anchor got upset!

00:16:45.588 --> 00:16:47.007
--You stupid Riko! Holes! Holes!
--Whoa!

00:16:47.007 --> 00:16:50.051
--Aria!
--You stupid Riko! Holes! Holes!

00:16:50.051 --> 00:16:52.012
Let's play "split-the-watermelon"!

00:16:52.012 --> 00:16:53.263
"Split-the-watermelon"?

00:16:53.263 --> 00:16:54.264
Yes!

00:16:54.264 --> 00:16:59.477
Boy, are you a kid or what?
I'm not gonna play a childish game like that.

00:16:59.477 --> 00:17:02.063
Besides, you shouldn't play with food.

00:17:02.063 --> 00:17:04.190
Yeah, let's do it!

00:17:04.190 --> 00:17:05.859
H-Hey! Stop! Let me go!

00:17:05.859 --> 00:17:08.903
--Let's all play together!
--H-Hey!

00:17:08.903 --> 00:17:12.824
Aria! A little to the right!

00:17:12.824 --> 00:17:15.285
Aria! A bit lower!

00:17:15.285 --> 00:17:17.746
That's right! Right around there!

00:17:17.746 --> 00:17:19.539
Split-the-watermelon <i>butei </i>style!

00:17:19.539 --> 00:17:22.208
Since we're using real bullets,
it gets really exciting!

00:17:22.208 --> 00:17:23.376
Hm?

00:17:23.376 --> 00:17:26.463
Watermelons from Tottori are delicious!

00:17:31.384 --> 00:17:32.761
Splendid!

00:17:44.439 --> 00:17:45.815
What do we do?

00:17:45.815 --> 00:17:49.611
It's Miss Urara's bathing suit
that's shrinking, not Akari's.

00:17:49.611 --> 00:17:52.447
Maybe it will go back to normal if it dries...

00:17:52.447 --> 00:17:54.616
Come on! Come on!

00:17:54.616 --> 00:17:56.951
Ahh... It's not going back to normal.

00:18:01.373 --> 00:18:02.665
Here you go, Akari.

00:18:02.665 --> 00:18:04.793
Akari, eat mine.

00:18:04.793 --> 00:18:05.627
Open wide.

00:18:05.627 --> 00:18:08.129
Ah! I found 10 yen!

00:18:08.129 --> 00:18:11.383
Wh-What're you doing all of a sudden?

00:18:11.383 --> 00:18:13.468
Wh-What're <i>you </i>doing?

00:18:13.468 --> 00:18:16.638
Oh, it was just a bottle cap.

00:18:16.638 --> 00:18:17.722
Tee-hee.

00:18:17.722 --> 00:18:21.267
Geez, Sis... What did I tell you earlier?

00:18:23.478 --> 00:18:26.648
It's still not shrinking? Not yet?

00:18:33.613 --> 00:18:37.867
Isn't it... Takachiho's bathing suit
that's actually shrinking?

00:18:39.661 --> 00:18:43.331
It's about time for the
scenery on the ceiling to change.

00:18:48.545 --> 00:18:50.839
Wow... That's amazing!

00:18:50.839 --> 00:18:53.508
It didn't shrink after all...

00:18:53.508 --> 00:18:56.845
Then, I'll go for the last resort.

00:18:56.845 --> 00:18:59.973
I'll put her in warm water
to make it shrink in an instant!

00:18:59.973 --> 00:19:02.350
That's the "final resort button"!

00:19:02.350 --> 00:19:04.853
Th-This is it!

00:19:04.853 --> 00:19:08.023
We can have a better view here.

00:19:08.023 --> 00:19:09.065
Okay!

00:19:11.901 --> 00:19:15.030
The pitfall to the heated pool is right here!

00:19:15.030 --> 00:19:18.241
We're gonna slip into
our little love room alone.

00:19:20.243 --> 00:19:22.412
What're you two doing?! Don't interrupt!

00:19:22.412 --> 00:19:24.330
Please don't, Miss Urara!

00:19:24.330 --> 00:19:26.207
--Or you'll become a pervert!
--Yuyu! Yaya! Stop it!

00:19:26.207 --> 00:19:29.836
I-I was right! They must've
gotten switched at some point!

00:19:29.836 --> 00:19:31.338
We're aborting the operation!

00:19:31.338 --> 00:19:32.380
Operation?

00:19:32.380 --> 00:19:34.716
What?! You, too?! Are you betraying me?!

00:19:34.716 --> 00:19:36.384
Ow!

00:19:36.384 --> 00:19:38.219
Ah...

00:19:38.219 --> 00:19:40.680
Ahhhhh!

00:19:43.683 --> 00:19:45.560
Th-This is...

00:19:47.062 --> 00:19:49.272
My heated pool of love.

00:19:49.272 --> 00:19:53.026
The operation was ruined because of you.

00:19:53.026 --> 00:19:56.321
T-Takachiho!

00:19:56.321 --> 00:19:59.115
Hm...? Whoa!

00:19:59.115 --> 00:20:00.408
How'd that happen?!

00:20:00.408 --> 00:20:02.702
M-Miss Urara...!

00:20:02.702 --> 00:20:04.204
W-We're sorry!

00:20:04.204 --> 00:20:07.165
We mixed up the bathing suits!

00:20:07.165 --> 00:20:11.044
You... useless idiots!

00:20:11.044 --> 00:20:12.712
Give me yours!

00:20:12.712 --> 00:20:15.507
There's no way I can do that!

00:20:15.507 --> 00:20:20.220
What were you planning to do to Akari,
preparing such an indecent room?!

00:20:20.220 --> 00:20:22.138
Don't ask such a personal question!

00:20:22.138 --> 00:20:24.599
I know you were thinking
about doing the same thing!

00:20:24.599 --> 00:20:26.476
--How shameless!
--Wh-What's going on?

00:20:26.476 --> 00:20:27.352
Don't look!

00:20:27.352 --> 00:20:29.104
You don't need to see!

00:20:32.774 --> 00:20:36.486
Well... we ended up playing
out here all day, huh?

00:20:36.486 --> 00:20:40.031
I had lots of fun!

00:20:40.031 --> 00:20:41.616
Sigh...

00:20:41.616 --> 00:20:45.120
Well, we were able to record a lot.

00:20:45.120 --> 00:20:49.624
We obtained the cup and
the silverware that she used, too.

00:20:49.624 --> 00:20:52.377
I guess it's okay.

00:20:52.377 --> 00:20:55.255
Miss Urara doesn't lose heart, does she?

00:20:55.255 --> 00:20:56.506
Nope.

00:21:01.970 --> 00:21:03.805
It made it!

00:21:03.805 --> 00:21:07.475
I'm going to videotape Mr. Kin at night.

00:21:07.475 --> 00:21:08.685
Hm?

00:21:10.311 --> 00:21:12.647
A balloon came flying.

00:21:12.647 --> 00:21:16.317
Yaay! Gracias, brother!

00:21:16.317 --> 00:21:18.153
Who the hell are you?!

00:21:20.113 --> 00:21:21.322
Hm?

00:21:21.322 --> 00:21:23.658
Ah! Aria!

00:21:23.658 --> 00:21:25.744
It was fun today, wasn't it?

00:21:25.744 --> 00:21:28.329
I was able to relax a little, too.

00:21:30.498 --> 00:21:33.043
Ah! Peach buns are walking outside the room!

00:21:33.043 --> 00:21:34.461
What?!

00:21:36.671 --> 00:21:37.797
I did it!

00:21:37.797 --> 00:21:40.342
I got it back! I got it back!

00:21:40.342 --> 00:21:41.426
Hm?

00:21:41.426 --> 00:21:42.594
Huh?

00:21:46.848 --> 00:21:48.516
That wasn't fair!

00:21:48.516 --> 00:21:51.353
Yeah, I guess it wasn't, huh?

00:21:51.353 --> 00:21:55.190
I'm sorry for being mean
yesterday and saying I was busy.

00:21:55.190 --> 00:21:58.610
Spending time with you guys wasn't too bad.

00:21:58.610 --> 00:22:02.697
So shall we spend time together again soon?

00:22:02.697 --> 00:22:05.325
Spend time... together...?

00:22:05.325 --> 00:22:06.493
Akari...

00:22:07.619 --> 00:22:08.203
"Episode 8: Pool Trap"

00:22:08.203 --> 00:22:11.081
"Episode 8: Pool Trap"
I'll visit you at your home.

00:23:41.546 --> 00:23:43.882
I'll stay at your place
for a while starting today.

00:23:43.882 --> 00:23:46.718
Since there might be
bad guys out there after Aria,

00:23:46.718 --> 00:23:48.803
she's just evacuating to my place for a while.

00:23:50.597 --> 00:23:52.932
Akari! Shoot!

00:23:52.932 --> 00:23:55.018
I'm not perfect.

00:23:55.310 --> 00:23:56.203
"Episode 9: Home Visit"
